    "text": "Drop a 💐 below to affirm!\n\nHappy International Women’s Day! Today, we celebrate the women who inspire us, challenge us, nurture us, and expand what feels possible. Thank you to the women dreaming boldly, building new paths, leading with courage, and reminding us every day that compassion and strength can exist together.\n\nToday we are also holding space for the women whose voices, safety, and dignity are too often pushed to the margins. Your lives matter. Your futures matter. Your humanity matters.\n\nThe world is better because women exist. 🧡\n\n#InternationalWomensDay \n\nFor more daily healing at your fingertips, get a copy of our debut book now @ wetheurban.com. More in our bio. 🫶🏽\n\nwords: @williegreene_",
